  "description": "Approved pathways for discarding unsellable returns.",
  "definition": "'Recycle' for materials separated for recycling streams; 'Hazardous Waste' for components containing batteries, chemicals, or e-waste; 'Landfill' for non-recyclable residuals; 'Return to Vendor' for supplier agrees to take back for specialised processing."
